# === Explorer ST project cleanup (2026-06-14): venvs, drive data, caches, artifacts ===
# Python virtual environments (named variants the base .venv/ pattern misses)
.venv*/
venv*/
# byte-compiled / numpy caches
__pycache__/
*.npz
*.npy
# raw drive logs (large; pulled from device — regenerable while the device retains the routes)
rlog
rlog_*
qlog*
*.qlog
# drive-data directories (rlog segment stores, NOT source) + scratch
explorer_st_logs/route_*/
explorer_st_logs/0000*/
explorer_st_logs/_*/
explorer_st_logs/analysis/
G70 logs/
cleanroom_lateral_analysis/drives/
# per-analysis extracted-signal caches (regenerable by the extractors)
**/cache/
**/results/cache/
# stray build/test artifacts + editor workspace
*.err
*.code-workspace
# derived per-route analysis dumps (regenerable by the analysis scripts) + run logs
explorer_st_logs/*results*.txt
explorer_st_logs/*.log
# PRIVATE — clean-room de-blinding key; must never be committed/shared
explorer_st_logs/CLEANROOM_DEBLINDING_KEY.md
explorer_st_logs/CLEANROOM_HANDOFF_PROMPT.md
# analysis figures: *.png is LFS-tracked but the LFS endpoint (gitlab) is unreachable from forks —
# these plots are regenerable, so keep them out of git rather than create dangling LFS pointers
cleanroom_lateral_analysis/analysis/figures/
**/analysis/figures/*.png
longitudinal_weave/**/*.png
learned_param_studies/**/*.png
